<title>USA: ATC Group says warrants not exercisable.</title>
<headline>ATC Group says warrants not exercisable.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATC Group Services Inc said Friday its Class C Warrants expiring April 30, 1998, will not be exercisable after the close of business on June 3, 1997, until a current registration statement is filed and declared effective by the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The company said it will file a registration as soon as is practicable and it will notify warrant holders when the registration statement has been declared effective.</p>
</text>
